  "description": "A standard full-body Holtzman field stops fast projectiles and hurried melee blows. Deliberate slow blades require Melee 10 to attempt penetration; specialist drilling darts visibly lodge before passing through. Blocked impacts postpone recharge for twelve seconds. The field automatically rises when drafted, fighting or attacked; it lowers during ranged aiming, bursts and recovery so the wearer can shoot, then returns if combat continues. Heat, explosions and EMP bypass the field. Its emissions attract Makers on exposed sand. Lasgun contact overloads the belt and causes a dangerous local blast. The bounded blast and rechargeable energy reserve are frontier combat abstractions.",
