    "overview": {
      "body": "A body-following field blocks fast impacts. Skilled deliberate blades require Melee 10 and retain native armor checks; specialist Drillshot darts lodge before penetrating. Each blocked hit pauses recharge for twelve seconds. The native Belt/Waist utility slot prevents stacking fields. Luna confirmed the body contour and blue/red reactions. The supplied final startup and breach sounds handle activation/recovery and penetration/overload. Tiny lodged-needle readability/movement and live audio mix remain acceptance work. The enabled belt raises in combat and lowers for ranged aiming, bursts and recovery; idle equipment is ready but inactive. Skilled blades default to automatic fencing against active shields. Inspect text distinguishes energy units from percentage."
    }
  },
